{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t在北京，外交部在例行記者會回應澳洲防長稱中國在地區的軍力增長為東南亞造成極大壓力。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n發言人郭嘉昆表示，中國堅持走和平發展道路，發展軍力旨在維護國家主權、安全和發展利益，從不針對任何國家，亦不搞軍事擴張，有關方面應該客觀看待，停止發表不負責任的言論。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：鄭皓璟\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T14:22:02.501718+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T13:57:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T15:18:46.703207+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:18:43.265323+00:00","content_hash":"7ad42c6925cf62bc9093454f0e9f962208f05731670f7d0dff2c258592f00a34","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}